{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/2a5f6d376b9d7c018c6ad479f870707a.avif?t=1773324797\" width=954 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/de4c578951be40a4b33d8470cd9932e3.poster.avif?t=1773324797\" width=608 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/de4c578951be40a4b33d8470cd9932e3.webm?t=1773324797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/de4c578951be40a4b33d8470cd9932e3.mp4?t=1773324797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some parts of the world are enchanted with timeloop magic. After several steps, you'll be sent back to where you entered. Discover the rules of this world and see how far they can take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/5f758a0748be9fbdb53a6f432b23c58f.avif?t=1773324797\" width=954 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4c4c0da3c4e9edfe40a9536183afdfc1.poster.avif?t=1773324797\" width=608 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4c4c0da3c4e9edfe40a9536183afdfc1.webm?t=1773324797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4c4c0da3c4e9edfe40a9536183afdfc1.mp4?t=1773324797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is handcrafted to teach you a new rule about the world. There's no filler or chores, just a pure rule-discovery metroidBRAINIA experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/e4f802058af36b8acd4e230623f5c60e.avif?t=1773324797\" width=954 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/5d7bb76338c472a9bc1460d2a88e2f08.poster.avif?t=1773324797\" width=608 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/5d7bb76338c472a9bc1460d2a88e2f08.webm?t=1773324797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/5d7bb76338c472a9bc1460d2a88e2f08.mp4?t=1773324797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your progress is only limited by your knowledge, not by artificial unlocks. What seemed impossible before might just need a second look. Yes, you could have done that the entire time! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Puzzle Design</strong> -  Solve puzzles by manipulating local timeloops in creative ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knowledge-based Progression </strong> - Explore a world where your only limit is what you know.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets &amp; meta puzzles</strong> - Think outside the box to solve layered, interconnected puzzles. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.